title: The Banking Bill
subtitle: More troops, or a chance at peace?
tags: event
view-if: war and date >= 144 and not banking_bill_seen
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_trade.svg
on-arrival: banking_bill_seen = 1

= The Banking Bill

The war is bankrupting the Republic. [? if rc_chancellor : The Security Bloc and the guilds propose?][? if not rc_chancellor : The Chancellor's allies propose?] to **deregulate the banks** so the Republic can borrow enough for [? if kamino_army : five million more clone troopers?][? if not kamino_army : a crash expansion of the Judicial Forces and the member-world fleets, since there is no clone army to grow?]. [? if bonteri_contact : At the same moment, Mina Bonteri has persuaded the Separatist Parliament to vote on a peace overture, if the Republic will show restraint. ?]

- @peace: Oppose deregulation and give the peace overture a chance.
- @clones: Support deregulation to fund the war.

@peace
subtitle: [? if bonteri_contact : +1 peace channel. The Security Bloc is furious. ?][? if not bonteri_contact : The Security Bloc is furious. ?]
on-arrival: {!
var st = {pal: 0.95, sec: 0.95, mod: 0.5, guild: 0.75, ind: 0.45, rim: 0.3, rfc: 0.25};
Q.bk_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 0, '-regulate');
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Banking Deregulation Bill', Q.bk_vote);
if (Q.bk_vote >= 50) { if (Q.kamino_army) Q.clones += 1.5; else Q.judicial_forces += 1.5; Q.corruption += 2; Q.war_balance += 0.5; Q.banking_dereg = 1; }
else if (Q.bonteri_contact) { Q.peace_talks += 1; }
Q.sec_relation -= 6; Q.pacifist_dissent -= 4;
!}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if banking_dereg : The deregulation passes anyway. The banks lend, [? if kamino_army : the clone vats fill, ?][? if not kamino_army : the recruiting offices fill, ?]and the peace overture dies. ?][? if not banking_dereg : The deregulation fails. [? if bonteri_contact : On Raxus, Mina Bonteri's peace motion passes. It is the first real hope in a year. ?] ?]

@clones
subtitle: The war goes better; corruption and debt grow.
on-arrival: {!
var st = {pal: 0.95, sec: 0.95, mod: 0.5, guild: 0.75, ind: 0.45, rim: 0.3, rfc: 0.25};
Q.bk_vote = SW.vote(Q, st, 1, '-regulate');
Q.vote_html = SW.voteBanner('Banking Deregulation Bill', Q.bk_vote);
if (Q.bk_vote >= 50) { if (Q.kamino_army) Q.clones += 1.5; else Q.judicial_forces += 1.5; Q.corruption += 2; Q.war_balance += 0.5; Q.banking_dereg = 1; }
Q.hawk_dissent -= 4; Q.pacifist_dissent += 6;
!}

[+ vote_html +]
